es to  turn ray into a sausage  he takes the sausage to the bakery where  catherine is  he then tries to explain everything to  her but catherine still cannot believe  him finally neil turns ray back into his  original form  on the other side the aliens do not like  what neil has been doing all this time  because he has not done anything useful  with the superpowers  arriving at her apartment catherine is  very surprised to see grant who was  somehow already at her house  she then locks him inside therefore neil  who sees the incident immediately  invites her to hide in his room  shortly after grant successfully breaks  inside through the window and directly  points his gun at kneel but neil does  not seem afraid of him  using his power he breaks grant's arm  and then fixes it revealing his ability  to grant wishes whenever he says a wish  and makes a hand gesture  on the other hand catherine chooses to  leave the two of them fighting when neal  is off guard grant manages to kidnap him  tying his hand and gagging him to  prevent his escape he also forces neil  to grant some selfish or absurd wishes  such as giving all native english people  huge ears and duck feet while  threatening to shoot dennis  in the meantime catherine looks for neil  in his apartment but instead encounters  rey who is hiding in a closet from miss  pringle's pursuit just at the right time  they managed to arrive at grant's house  and immediately rescue neil who was able  to reverse all of grant's wishes  including miss pringle's now violently  fanatical worship of rey who was close  to being ritually killed by her and the  cult she created beforehand  still catherine and rey decide to leave  him alone because they are already  disappointed in him  soon catherine angrily tells neil that  she will never be able to love anyone  who has the superpowers to control  anything disartan he suddenly has the  idea of using his powers to solve the  world's problems  at first he grants everyone in the worl